[TITLE]
Preissmann slot regression model (issue #144)
Three 1-ft circular pipes forced far past capacity so the SLOT surcharge
method is active for most of the run, with 30-ft junctions that hold the
water in the slot instead of flooding it away.  This is the only model in
the suite that runs SURCHARGE_METHOD SLOT, so it is the sole coverage of
the conveyance-area momentum path (dwflow.c::getConveyArea and
DynamicWave.cpp::conveyArea).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
SURCHARGE_METHOD     SLOT
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             04:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             0
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
DRY_STEP             00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:05
INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
FORCE_MAIN_EQUATION  H-W
VARIABLE_STEP        0.75
LENGTHENING_STEP     0
MIN_SURFAREA         12.557
MAX_TRIALS           8
HEAD_TOLERANCE       0.005
SYS_FLOW_TOL         5
LAT_FLOW_TOL         5

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev   MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       100    30        0          0         0
J2       99.5   30        0          0         0
J3       99.0   30        0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev   Type   Stage  Gated
OUT      98.0   FREE          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To    Length  Roughness  InOff  OutOff  InitFlow  MaxFlow
C1       J1    J2    400     0.015      0      0       0         0
C2       J2    J3    400     0.015      0      0       0         0
C3       J3    OUT   400     0.015      0      0       0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C2       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C3       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
J1       FLOW         SURGE       FLOW  1.0      1.0

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name  Date        Time   Value
SURGE               0:00   0.0
SURGE               0:10   12.0
SURGE               2:30   12.0
SURGE               3:00   0.0
SURGE               4:00   0.0

[REPORT]
INPUT      NO
CONTROLS   NO
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL

[TAGS]

[MAP]
DIMENSIONS 0.000 0.000 1000.000 1000.000
Units      None

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X       Y
J1       100     500
J2       400     500
J3       700     500
OUT      1000    500
